cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SamaReew data or code, please cite it as below."
title: "SamaReew: urban expansion in Senegalese cities, 2016–2025"
abstract: >-
  Open-data atlas comparing Senegalese cities (Dakar, Touba, Thiès, Mbour). Built-up
  areas are mapped every year from Sentinel-2 imagery with Google Earth Engine and one
  national Random Forest model, cleaned with a temporal consistency filter and checked by
  an independent accuracy assessment of 480 photo-interpreted points.
type: software
authors:
